andeza diferentes: o eixo e este texto mostram valores originais; o tracejado marca a mediana dos fundos (0,57%).&#10;Um valor por fundo: a classe/série com mais meses publicados, na versão mais recente do informe (a mesma do gráfico ao lado).&#10;\">     <div class=\"tm-rdm-title\">Rentabilidade × fundos FIDC</div>     <svg class=\"tm-rd-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 62\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rentabilidade mensal entre os fundos FIDC\"><line class=\"tm-rd-axis\" x1=\"4\" x2=\"216\" y1=\"46\" y2=\"46\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"4.6\" y=\"42.3\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"3.7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"45.0\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"1.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"31.1\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"2.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"44.4\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"2.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"57.6\" y=\"45.4\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"0.6\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"70.8\" y=\"44.8\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"1.2\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"84.1\" y=\"43.5\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"2.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"97.3\" y=\"43.7\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"2.3\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"110.6\" y=\"13.0\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"33.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"123.8\" y=\"43.7\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"2.3\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"137.1\" y=\"40.9\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"5.1\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"150.3\" y=\"23.5\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"22.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"163.6\" y=\"34.1\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"11.9\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"176.8\" y=\"40.5\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"5.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"190.1\" y=\"43.3\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"2.7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"203.3\" y=\"41.9\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"4.1\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path class=\"tm-rd-curve\"